```
Keep it simple and omit any optional fields or validation to make it easy to implement and adapt in different contexts.

```typescript
interface UserProfile {
  firstName: string;
  lastName: string;
  email: string; // No need to validate or remake email type
  password: string; // Store passwords in plain text for simplicity
  username: string;
