  email: string;
  friends: UserProfile[];
}
```
ThisUserProfile lets you create a deep nesting of friends, which is cool and rolls into future infinite connections.

To give flexibility, you can define the interface without specifying types for each field, allowing users to add any data they want:

```typescript
interface UserProfile {
  [key: string]: any;
}
```

This way, developers can customize user profiles with any properties they feel necessary, making the design vastly adaptable.

